// The Crawler Lab's rules (crawler_lab.ron): the elder, and three of the
// Sacred Tree's ghouls a few seconds apart, walking from the south-east
// corner past the parked crawler to the north-west one. Each turns on an
// elder it sees within 3 m and gives up past 5 m. Player combat is off
// (no player_health), so their swings do no harm; reaching the far corner
// only counts against a base the lab doesn't have.
